{"nodes": [{"id": "scripts_readme", "label": "README de la biblioth\u00e8que de scripts", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "scripts_readme_no_db_scripts", "label": "Aucun contenu de script stock\u00e9 en base", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L78-83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Les scripts sont ex\u00e9cut\u00e9s en SYSTEM ou en root sur toutes les machines d'une formation, \u00e0 partir d'un clic dans une interface web. Ils vivent dans le d\u00e9p\u00f4t et nulle part ailleurs : c'est ce qui fait qu'ajouter du code ex\u00e9cutable passe forc\u00e9ment par un commit relu. Pas d'\u00e9diteur en ligne, pas de contenu de script en base."}, {"id": "scripts_readme_windows_localsystem", "label": "Contraintes Windows : guest agent en LocalSystem", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L66-76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le guest agent tourne en LocalSystem : pas de profil utilisateur, pas de session interactive. winget est donc inutilisable \u2014 c'est une application MSIX par utilisateur \u2014 d'o\u00f9 le passage par Chocolatey via requires: [choco]. Le PATH du guest agent date du d\u00e9marrage du service, donc les ex\u00e9cutables install\u00e9s sont appel\u00e9s par chemin complet. Les groupes int\u00e9gr\u00e9s portant des noms traduits, on les vise par SID (S-1-5-32-544, S-1-5-32-555)."}, {"id": "scripts_readme_script_rules", "label": "R\u00e8gles d'\u00e9criture d'un script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L41-64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le contexte arrive par fichier et non par arguments : un mot de passe en ligne de commande serait visible dans la liste des processus de la VM, et le fichier est supprim\u00e9 en fin de configuration. Les scripts doivent \u00eatre idempotents (rejouables), sortir non nul en cas d'\u00e9chec (seul signal d'erreur), \u00e9crire sur stdout (conserv\u00e9 et affich\u00e9 dans le d\u00e9tail de la VM), et tenir sous 60 Ko (limite d'agent/file-write)."}], "edges": [{"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_context_file", "target": "scripts_readme_script_rules", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L41-55", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme_script_rules", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_file_write_max_chars", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L64", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme_windows_localsystem", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_interpretercommand", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.65, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L66-72", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme_windows_localsystem", "target": "pipeline_configure_vm_preparedirectorycommand", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L75-76", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_proxmox_agent_withpowershellbom", "target": "scripts_readme_windows_localsystem", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L73-74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme", "target": "scripts_registry_scriptentryschema", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L19-39", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme", "target": "scripts_readme_no_db_scripts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L78-83", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme", "target": "scripts_readme_script_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L41-64", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme", "target": "scripts_readme_windows_localsystem", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L66-76", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "scripts_readme_no_db_scripts", "target": "scripts_registry_resolvescriptpath", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "scripts/README.md", "source_location": "L39", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}